        "avatar": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/Ry6CH7o1nMGa_JDNnJA-_YgtKGPzpHTviEZQv5aK5V9ZEWHqCT6gCqWxk5aI9X7tky58wQb8MUkp7miYDvDh-XN3Yrq_6YhKH87iw3X4QFdwqhqiNiCDd3-f6nXlySRAlH22d23uqpfN5Ftz5kHZME85FYe0-YzBRath67ofx7Z29Tv2E95awxUspa_Q-ku5-xnagymdwmJgKgwvTJd5X-AY6hu-5noGx644kL7mDsmQA5Zjp2IHP34hkWA4F7nPal01W-bDSvAPEtneeOZoAlAwpOfuaiDNYcOtoWxpIpktW1Ask6rXImrpCLoyV4w9egJyKa2nv8u0hBPb7kJUwg.jpg"
